{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1376066-is-there-a-short-technocracy-guide-for-players","id":1376066,"title":"is there a short technocracy guide for players?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-03-21T22:06:19-07:00","id":1376066,"title":"is there a short technocracy guide for players?","content":"I need a quick read for my players who are new-ish to mage and new new to the technocracy. They are playing technocrats and need to be introduced to this aspect of the game. <br /> <br /> anyone got anything?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3148-zennis","name":"Zennis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-22T06:09:57-07:00","id":1376101,"title":"","content":"Don\u2019t know how short you want it, but M20 pages 166-195 has a great description of the Technocracy and their methods (mainly describing what is different from traditional methods).<br /> <br /> It was free in one day this week.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-22T07:50:25-07:00","id":1376109,"title":"","content":"If I was the ST here, I'd have them read the section Mateus mentioned, hit the WoD Wiki, and then I'd pick a movie or show I felt captured what I wanted to convey and have them watch it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Any technology distinguishable from magic is insufficiently advanced.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12101-nitromidas","name":"Nitromidas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-22T12:17:24-07:00","id":1376132,"title":"","content":"The Revised Convention books are fairly short, and all but Iteration X were written by Onyx Path relatively recently. Not everything in them is going to apply to a M20 game, but they're pretty good for helping get started with their Conventions as they can be harder than the Traditions to understand the divisions between them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4